      "root_argument": "ARG0 before set_mmu_ttb_alternate",
      "walk": "TTBR1 4 KiB, T1SZ=26/TG1=2 only; reads L1/L2/L3 descriptors through the old TTBR1 linear alias after AT S1E1R confirms the physical page",
